    {
      "title": "Layered Architecture Diagram (in source)",
      "description": "The diagram in the doc maps directly to the package boundaries:\n\n1. VS Code Extension Host → `plugin-core` + `dendron-plugin-views`\n2. Dendron Engine → `engine-server` (DendronEngineV2)\n3. Shared Primitives → `common-all`, `common-server`\n4. Markdown Pipeline → `unified` package (remark/rehype)\n5. Data Layer → SQLite (via prisma) + plain FS + `dendron.yml`\n\nWe will visit each of these in the tour steps that follow.",
      "file": "docs/dev/01-ARCHITECTURE-OVERVIEW.md",
      "line": 20,
      "selection": {
