    {
      "title": "DI Container (tsyringe) - The Hidden Wiring",
      "description": "Dendron uses **tsyringe** + `reflect-metadata` + legacy decorators.\n\n- `setupLocalExtContainer()` in plugin-core wires almost everything\n- Classes are `@injectable()`, constructor params use `@inject(Token)`\n- This makes testing dramatically easier (swap real engine for mocks)\n- It also explains why some \"global\" singletons exist\n\n**Current modernization tax**: TS 5.5+ stricter decorator checking means many `@ts-expect-error` comments around inject sites (see the strict-mode-fixer and ts-expect-error-burner skills in `.grok/skills/`).\n\n[Open the container setup](./packages/plugin-core/src/injection-providers/setupLocalExtContainer.ts)",
      "file": "packages/plugin-core/src/injection-providers/setupLocalExtContainer.ts",
      "line": 1
    },
